Z||000030||Cheever2||01-04-2001||06:56 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by TheFiero64:<BR><B>We should all get together and have a card made to give to the Fiero driver. If we could locate where to send it.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>I just called the hospital and found out Anthony Barber is in room # 258.  I'm back at work again and can't do much more than that.  I would have flowers sent but Christmas got my credit cards up to their limits.  Fiero64... you want to do it?<BR>Or maybe one of our people in the Denver area, huh?<P>||||reg||1
